flowchart LR
  U([Pembeli]) -->|chat| UI[UI Chat web<br/>localhost:4000]
  UI -->|POST /chat| API
  subgraph RASA[Rasa Pro :5005]
    direction TB
    NCA[NLUCommandAdapter<br/>pipeline config.yml] --> TR[Tracker<br/>slot, form, riwayat]
    TR --> POL[Policies<br/>Rule / Memoization / TED]
    POL --> ACT[Custom Actions<br/>actions.py]
  end
  API[api-service Node.js<br/>Express :4000] -->|REST webhook| RASA
  RASA -->|POST /model/parse<br/>endpoints.yml nlu.url| NLU
  subgraph NLU[NLU service Flask :3000]
    direction TB
    EX[Entity extractor<br/>regex + gazetteer + fuzzy] --> NORM[Normalisasi<br/>slang, placeholder]
    NORM --> BERT[IndoBERT fine-tuned<br/>19 intent + fallback]
  end
  ACT -->|HTTP GET JSON| API
  API -->|SQL mysql2| DB[(MySQL MAMP :8889<br/>olshop_db)]
  TRAIN[[train_intent_model.py<br/>di luar Rasa]] -.->|model + tokenizer| BERT
  DS[(Dataset: Bitext CDLA-S<br/>+ DummyJSON MIT)] -.-> TRAIN
  DS -.-> DB
